"Syl is truly a slime, a Chimeric Cluster Slime (Prismatic) of race level 19, a tier-five monster."
"Syl was born a blue slime with a crimson core on a slime farm at Stantondale."
"Syl is a reincarnated soul, an [Experiment] of the god Gramps, marked by the [Unique] Emblem."
"In a past life Syl was a noble human prodigy of the Renait Federation, gifted in Dimension Magic."
"That past self was poisoned with a birthday cake by his jealous older brother."
"Syl keeps no memories of that past life, only a leftover dimensional affinity."
"Syl's elf body is a mimicked form; she can take any shape she has eaten a profile of."
"Syl gains the traits and forms of creatures she eats, and craves new slime cores most of all."
"Syl's true class is Riftmancer, level 22; her Identify is faked to read Elementalist."
"Syl runs twenty-four sub-cores and can split her slime into many bodies at once."
"Syl's personas Sylvain, Sylvester, Sylbera and Sylthaeryn are all Syl, run by her sub-cores."
"Each persona now lives as a person in its own right, with its own class and memories."
"Syl can fold, cut and suppress space, and keeps a private rift beside her wherever she goes."
"Syl can deconstruct her own skills to learn how they work and rebuild them as spells."
"Syl holds [Mana Dominion], a pinnacle of mana control granted by the goddess called Mother."
"Mother, a goddess of magic, sets Syl a lasting quest to explore every avenue of magic."
"Syl holds 7 Legend Points from world-changing deeds."
"Syl's [Dungeon Master] Emblem, usurped from Gloto, has hung pending for months."
"Syl carries a Dungeon CUBE that will let her found a dungeon once her Emblem is granted."
"Syl dreams of a slime dungeon and weighs a Queen Slime evolution to raise a slime race."
"Syl, as Sylvain, killed the mermen king and queen and destroyed their city of Azulean."
"The surviving mermen are marked to sense Syl anywhere and hunt her in blind rage."
"Syl killed the royal alicorn king of Glimmerock and two of his children."
"Syl killed the demon Traz'genauth Egrozk Xog'thizech and sealed the Labyrinth of the Abyss."
"The original Sylthaeryn Feirelle forced Syl through their bond to kill her."
"Loreleia, Paeris, Llewel, Keldenar, Vee, Leon, Yuzz and Simon know Syl is a slime."
"Keldenar's Eyes of Truth once exposed Syl as a slime, before he swore an oath of secrecy."
"Syl feels less human with every level, and needs far less sleep than she did."
"Syl may revive through a sub-core far away if her main body is destroyed."
